PROJECT: Cosmos

## Token Information

Official Token Name: Cosmos Hub Atom
Symbol: ATOM
Token Standard: Native (Cosmos SDK coin)
Blockchain: Cosmos Hub
Contract Address: Native denom `uatom` (no ERC-20 contract on Cosmos Hub; ERC-20 representations exist on Ethereum via bridges e.g., 0x0eb3a705fc54725037cc9e008bdede697f62f337 for Wormhole wrapped ATOM)
Decimals: 6 (base unit: uatom, 1 ATOM = 1,000,000 uatom)
Status: Live
Sources: https://github.com/cosmos/gaia/blob/main/docs/atom.md, https://cosmos.network/atom, https://www.mintscan.io/cosmos/tokens/uatom

## Supply

Maximum Supply: Tidak ada (unbounded / inflationary)
Total Supply: ~390,934,204 ATOM (per blok 19.500.000, Oktober 2024)
Circulating Supply: ~390,934,204 ATOM (sama dengan total supply karena tidak ada token terkunci pada protocol level; vesting hanya berlaku untuk alokasi awal investor/team yang sudah selesai)
Initial Supply: 236.198.958 ATOM (pada genesis 13 Maret 2019)
Supply Type: Inflationary (target inflation 7%–20% tergantung bonded ratio)
Sources: https://github.com/cosmos/gaia/blob/main/docs/atom.md, https://www.mintscan.io/cosmos/validators, https://cosmos.network/tokenomics, https://staking.duncan.id/cosmos

