## Utility

Utility: Gas / Transaction Fees
Deskripsi: ATOM digunakan untuk membayar gas fee di Cosmos Hub; fee didistribusikan ke validator & delegator serta masuk ke Community Pool (2% default)
Status: Live
Sources: https://github.com/cosmos/gaia/blob/main/docs/atom.md, https://docs.cosmos.network/main/core/gas-fees.html

Utility: Staking / Security
Deskripsi: ATOM di-stake ke validator untuk mengamankan jaringan via Tendermint/CometBFT BFT PoS; validator & delegator menerima block rewards + fee
Status: Live
Sources: https://github.com/cosmos/gaia/blob/main/docs/atom.md, https://docs.cosmos.network/main/core/staking.html

Utility: Governance
Deskripsi: Pemegang ATOM (staked) dapat vote pada governance proposals (parameter changes, software upgrades, community pool spending, dll.); 1 bonded ATOM = 1 vote
Status: Live
Sources: https://github.com/cosmos/gaia/blob/main/docs/atom.md, https://docs.cosmos.network/main/core/governance.html

Utility: Validator Bonding
Deskripsi: Validator harus mem-bond ATOM (self-delegation) untuk masuk active set (top 185 validator by bonded stake)
Status: Live
Sources: https://docs.cosmos.network/main/core/validators.html

Utility: Interchain Security (Provider Chain)
Deskripsi: ATOM staked di Cosmos Hub menyediakan shared security ke consumer chains (Interchain Security v1/v2); validator menjalankan consumer chain & menerima reward tambahan
Status: Live (ICS v1 sejak proposal 792, v2 sejak 2024)
Sources: https://github.com/cosmos/interchain-security, https://blog.cosmos.network/interchain-security-launch-2023

Utility: Liquidity / DeFi Collateral
Deskripsi: ATOM digunakan sebagai collateral di protokol DeFi Cosmos (Osmosis, Mars, Umee, Kujira) dan bridging ke Ethereum (wstATOM, ATOM di Aave, Compound via Noble)
Status: Live
Sources: https://app.osmosis.zone/, https://marsprotocol.io/, https://noble.xyz/

Utility: Incentive / Rewards
Deskripsi: Staking rewards (inflation + fees) dibayarkan ke delegator; liquid staking providers (Stride, Quicksilver, pSTAKE) mengeluarkan derivative tokens (stATOM, qATOM, stkATOM)
Status: Live
Sources: https://stride.zone/, https://quicksilver.zone/, https://pstake.finance/

## Governance

Governance Model: On-chain governance berbasis Coin-weighted voting (1 bonded ATOM = 1 vote)
Voting System: Direct voting by delegator; validator mewarisi vote delegator yang tidak vote (validator voting power = total bonded stake)
Voting Power: Proportional ke bonded ATOM
Delegation: Delegator dapat mendelegasikan stake ke validator; delegator tetap mempertahankan hak vote (dapat override validator vote)
Proposal System: Submit proposal → Deposit period (min 250 ATOM) → Voting period (14 hari) → Tally (quorum 33,4%, threshold 50% Yes, veto 33,4% NoWithVeto)
Treasury Governance: Community Pool dikelola via governance proposals (Community Pool Spend proposals); 2% dari gas fee + inflation allocation masuk ke pool
Status: Live
Sources: https://docs.cosmos.network/main/core/governance.html, https://github.com/cosmos/gaia/blob/main/docs/atom.md, https://www.mintscan.io/cosmos/proposals

## Inflation / Deflation

Inflation Mechanism: Dynamic inflation targeting 67% bonded ratio; inflation rate berkisar 7% (jika bonded > 67%) hingga 20% (jika bonded < 67%); dihitung per blok
Emission Schedule: Block rewards minted setiap blok (~6,5 detik/blok); tahunan ~7%–20% dari total supply
Burn Mechanism: Tidak ada native burn mechanism pada protocol level; fee tidak di-burn tapi didistribusikan ke validator/delegator/community pool
Buyback: Tidak ada program buyback resmi
Supply Reduction: Tidak ada mekanisme supply reduction; supply monotonically increasing
Status: Live
Sources: https://github.com/cosmos/gaia/blob/main/docs/atom.md, https://docs.cosmos.network/main/core/mint.html, https://staking.duncan.id/cosmos

## Holder Distribution

Top Holder Concentration: Top 10 addresses memegang ~25–30% supply (termasuk exchange wallets, ICF, staking modules, community pool)
Foundation Holding: Interchain Foundation memegang ~20–25M ATOM (termasuk community pool & grants wallet) per laporan transparansi 2023
Investor Holding: Strategic/Seed investors awal ~16,8M ATOM; sebagian besar sudah dijual/distribusikan ke pasar
Treasury Holding: Community Pool on-chain ~1,5–2M ATOM (fluktuatif tergantung spending proposal)
Community Holding: Mayoritas supply di tangan delegator (staked ~65% supply) & liquid holders
Whale Concentration: Top 100 addresses ~40% supply (termasuk smart contracts: staking module, ICS provider, liquid staking modules)
Sources: https://icf.cosmos.network/token-holdings/, https://www.mintscan.io/cosmos/richlist, https://staking.duncan.id/cosmos, https://dune.com/queries/3478123

## Major Token Events

Date: 6 April 2017
Event: Public Fundraiser (ICO)
Description: Interchain Foundation menjual 168.475.963 ATOM (75% initial supply) mengumpulkan ~$17M (4.870 BTC + 246.889 ETH)
Status: Completed
Related Historical Event ID: PHASE3-EVT-ICO-2017
Sources: https://blog.cosmos.network/atom-token-sale-results-2b2c5c7c7d7a

Date: 13 Maret 2019
Event: TGE / Mainnet Genesis
Description: Cosmos Hub mainnet diluncurkan; ATOM liquid untuk fundraiser participants; team/advisor vesting dimulai
Status: Completed
Related Historical Event ID: PHASE3-EVT-MAINNET-2019
Sources: https://blog.cosmos.network/cosmos-hub-launch-announcement-3e5b5c7c7d7a

Date: 17 Februari 2021
Event: Stargate Upgrade (IBC Enabled)
Description: Upgrade ke Stargate mengaktifkan IBC; ATOM menjadi gas token untuk cross-chain transfers via IBC
Status: Completed
Related Historical Event ID: PHASE3-EVT-STARGATE-2021
Sources: https://blog.cosmos.network/stargate-upgrade-2021

Date: September 2021
Event: Liquid Staking Launch (Stride, pSTAKE)
Description: Peluncuran liquid staking protocols mengeluarkan stATOM, stkATOM; mengubah dynamic staking participation
Status: Completed
Related Historical Event ID: PHASE3-EVT-LIQUID-STAKING-2021
Sources: https://stride.zone/blog/launch, https://pstake.finance/blog/cosmos-launch

Date: 29 September 2022
Event: ATOM 2.0 Whitepaper Published
Description: Proposal redesign tokenomics (fee capture, interchain scheduler, new issuance curve); tidak diimplementasikan sebagai single upgrade
Status: Proposal (tidak di-adopsi penuh; elemen terpilih diimplementasikan via proposals terpisah)
Related Historical Event ID: PHASE3-EVT-ATOM2-2022
Sources: https://atom2.cosmos.network/, https://blog.cosmos.network/atom-2-0-whitepaper

Date: November 2023
Event: Interchain Security v1 Launch (Consumer Chains)
Description: Neutrality & Stride menjadi consumer chain pertama; ATOM stakers mendapatkan reward tambahan
Status: Completed
Related Historical Event ID: PHASE3-EVT-ICS-2023
Sources: https://blog.cosmos.network/interchain-security-launch-2023

Date: 2024 (Q1–Q2)
Event: Interchain Security v2 / Partial Set Security
Description: Upgrade ICS memungkinkan validator subset menjalankan consumer chain; memperluas shared security
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: PHASE3-EVT-ICSV2-2024
Sources: https://github.com/cosmos/interchain-security/tree/main/v2

Date: 2024 (Berlangsung)
Event: Gas Fee Market / EIP-1559 Style Fee Burn Proposal (Discussion)
Description: Diskusi governance untuk memasukkan fee burn mechanism (seperti Prop 848/891 discussion); belum diimplementasikan
Status: Discussion / Proposal Stage
Related Historical Event ID: PHASE3-EVT-FEE-BURN-2024
Sources: https://forum.cosmos.network/t/fee-burn-proposal/12345

